        },
        {
          "text": "(Lino bana ba-Israyeli bakalonga kuzwa kuzikala zyabana ba-Jakani kuya ku-Mosera, nkonkuko Aroni nkwaakafwida akuzikwa nkabela mwanaakwe Eleazara wakaba mupaizi mucimanga cakwe. ",
