        },
        {
          "text": "Lino mebo ndakakala kucilundu mbubonya mbuli kuciindi citaanzi, mazuba aali makumi one, isikati amasiku, Nkabela Jehova wakandiswiilila kuciindi eco acalo; Jehova wakaleka kumunyonyoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
